 drivers/phy/mediatek/Kconfig      |   8 ++
 drivers/phy/mediatek/Makefile     |   1 +
 drivers/phy/mediatek/phy-mtk-dp.c | 201 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 211 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/phy/mediatek/phy-mtk-dp.c

